{"version":1,"content":"<p>傑夫·貝索斯在2017年做出了一次大膽押注。貝索斯是科幻和機械人愛好者，他確信消費者在不久的將來就會擁有家用機械人。這位亞馬遜創始人兼時任CEO告訴公司一羣頂級設備高管着手打造一台機械人。幾年之內，團隊就造出了售價1450美元的Astro。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585506.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.581047+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T14:49:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"937f29bbf5f4a0571ba3be50f634e646e324796c8471635d59e3d660725ad270","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}